---
description: Big screen, renderer, and dev harness
globs: web/screen/**,web/lib/renderer/**,web/dev/**,shared/presets.ts,shared/sceneLoader.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

See [ARCHITECTURE §6](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) and [D-16, D-17, D-20](../../docs/DECISIONS.md).

- 60fps budget: cap `pixelDensity` (1.5), draw base art once to an offscreen layer, no per-frame allocations, adaptive particle count.
- Seed everything from `round.seed` (`randomSeed`/`noiseSeed`); no `Math.random` or wall-clock in the live layer.
- Laptop display, no projector (D-38): design at 1920×1080, size chrome in `vw`/`vh` so 1280×720 keeps the composition; type readable by a group at ~2 m.
- Flicker ≤3 Hz, no full-screen strobe; enforced in presets, not overridable.
- `/screen` is passive: renders, plays audio, uploads the snapshot. No round-state writes.
- `/dev` and `/screen` share the same renderer module.
